OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 52, 'shocked' at GCSE pass
OL,4,Aon fifth attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 52-year-old woman said she was "happy
OL,7,Fand shocked" after she passed her GCSE
OL,8,Fmaths at the fifth time of asking.
OL,10,FWynne Hindle, 52, from Sudbury,
OL,11,FSuffolk, has been working toward her
OL,12,Fgoal of becoming a teaching assistant
OL,13,Fat a primary school and needed this
OL,14,Fqualification.
OL,16,FShe studied at West Suffolk College's
OL,17,Fadult learning centre in Bury St
OL,18,FEdmunds and received her results at
OL,19,Fabout 09:00 BST, achieving a grade 4.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
